      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To complete the task, I need to create a Python file that integrates with a managed key service for signing or verification. I will choose AWS KMS (Key Management Service) as the concrete external provider. The code will include the AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) to interact with AWS KMS, making the provider identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
