      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To implement envelope encryption using a managed key service, I will use AWS Key Management Service (KMS) as the concrete external provider. I will write the Python code to encrypt and decrypt data using AWS KMS. The provider will be identifiable by the import of the boto3 library and the use of the AWS KMS client. </thinking>\n",
